// lint_waivers.vlt -- Verilator lint waivers for COMMITTED files.
//
// Worker D cannot modify src/tt_um_pemu_pe.v, src/tt_um_pemu_observer.v, or
// src/tt_um_pemu_host.v beyond the authorized amendments. The warnings below
// are in those files, have been reviewed, and are accepted:
//
// - UNUSEDSIGNAL 'vnwords' (tt_um_pemu_host.v): leftover readback-count reg
//   from the VERIFY_IMEM implementation; never read, harmless.
// - SYNCASYNCNET 'rst_n': intended reset topology -- the host uses
//   async-assert/sync-deassert (rst_sync), the PE samples rst_n synchronously
//   (rst_n_d). Not a bug.
//
// Usage: verilator --lint-only -Wall ... test/lint_waivers.vlt ...
`verilator_config
lint_off -rule UNUSEDSIGNAL -match "vnwords"
lint_off -rule SYNCASYNCNET
